  - m_Id: 13000156217208832
    m_Localized: Great! you entered the door, now try to sit on the sofa using the
      trigger button.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 13000156259151872
    m_Localized: Here you can see the question. Press the arrow to continue!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 13000156259151873
    m_Localized: By pressing on the speaker button, you can produce the sound of
      what does the sentence sounds like.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 13000156259151874
    m_Localized: This is your selections, try to select one of the bubbles by saying
      it out loud.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 13000156259151875
    m_Localized: Here you can see the volume of your voice.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
